      wave director.
    visual: {fileID: 5237825957439511800, guid: c0246c684178e8c48b1da25c02447e85, type: 3}
    enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b58a6908d9b5d1c46a0ba485f50639c6, type: 2}
    weapon: {fileID: 0}
    inCurrentWaves: 0
  - id: AK47
    description: Your primary automatic rifle. Fire short bursts for control; aim
      down sights for distant contacts.
    visual: {fileID: 8708785552288788177, guid: c34dcb8f2eb300045a517b7371b5adea, type: 3}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    weapon: {fileID: 5099347201407060845, guid: f31e8efed9aea7f4bb8ec89bc894ab8c, type: 3}
    inCurrentWaves: 1
  - id: Pistol
    description: A semi-automatic backup. Switch when the rifle runs dry and make
      each shot count.
